{"unit_id":"Zam233__dsh-google-scholar#card-zh","repo":"Zam233/dsh-google-scholar","commit":"be11e728abfa796a0e328939bd033edd732d07cb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-google-scholar 是面向 DSH 的学术检索插件，通过注册三个 LLM 工具调用 SerpAPI 的 Google Scholar 引擎。它支持按检索词、作者或来源搜索论文，并可设置年份、语言、排序、结果数和分页；还能根据搜索结果中的标识查询施引文献或同一论文的其他版本。结果会整理为论文标题、作者、摘要片段、引用信息及可用 PDF 链接等文本。使用者需要配置 SerpAPI Key，适合研究者和需要收集学术文献的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:283-350","lib/index.js:62-75","lib/index.js:180-241"]}
{"unit_id":"Zam233__dsh-google-scholar#card-en","repo":"Zam233/dsh-google-scholar","commit":"be11e728abfa796a0e328939bd033edd732d07cb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-google-scholar adds three DSH tools for Google Scholar through SerpAPI: paper search with author, source, year, and language filters; citing-paper lookup; and alternate-version lookup. Results include paper details and links. A SerpAPI key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:283-350","lib/index.js:62-75","lib/index.js:180-241"]}
